      *================================================================*
      * TXPOST: POST TRANSACTIONS TO THE ACCOUNT MASTER                *
      *                                                                *
      * MATCHES THE SORTED TRANSACTIONS AGAINST THE OLD MASTER, BOTH   *
      * IN ACCOUNT NUMBER ORDER, AND WRITES THE NEW MASTER: EVERY OLD  *
      * RECORD, WITH ITS TRANSACTIONS APPLIED. EACH POSTING GOES TO    *
      * THE AUDIT TRAIL; A TRANSACTION THAT CANNOT BE POSTED GOES TO   *
      * THE REJECTS. BOTH ARE APPENDED TO, AS THE DAILY BATCH RUNS     *
      * TXPOST FOUR TIMES:                                             *
      *   0. THE MONTH-END INTEREST AND FEES FROM MONCHG, ON THE DAY   *
      *      A MONTH CLOSES; ON OTHER DAYS NONE.                       *
      *   1. THE DAY'S TRANSACTIONS. A POSTED TRANSFER WRITES A        *
      *      TRANSFER CREDIT FOR THE RECEIVING ACCOUNT TO THE LEGS.    *
      *   2. THE TRANSFER CREDITS, SORTED. ONE FOR AN UNKNOWN OR       *
      *      CLOSED ACCOUNT WRITES A RETURNED TRANSFER TO THE LEGS.    *
      *   3. THE RETURNED TRANSFERS, SORTED.                           *
      *                                                                *
      * RULES: NOTHING POSTS TO A CLOSED ACCOUNT. CREDITS AND FEES     *
      * POST TO A FROZEN ACCOUNT, WITHDRAWALS AND TRANSFERS DO NOT. A  *
      * DEBIT MAY TAKE THE BALANCE DOWN TO THE OVERDRAFT LIMIT, NO     *
      * FURTHER. A FEE ALWAYS POSTS, EVEN PAST THE LIMIT. INTEREST     *
      * POSTS AS A CREDIT, OVERDRAFT INTEREST, MAINTENANCE FEES AND    *
      * ATM FEES AS FEES. CARD PURCHASES AND ATM WITHDRAWALS WERE      *
      * AUTHORIZED WHEN THEY WERE MADE, AND POST AS DEBITS WHATEVER    *
      * THE BALANCE, EVEN TO AN ACCOUNT FROZEN SINCE.                  *
      *                                                                *
      * RETURN CODES: 0 ALL POSTED, 4 SOME REJECTED,                   *
      *               16 INPUT OUT OF ORDER, OUT OF BALANCE OR I/O.    *
      *                                                                *
      * MODIFICATION HISTORY                                           *
      * DATE       BY  CHANGE                                          *
      * 1987-04-02 JA  ORIGINAL VERSION.                               *
      * 1994-11-14 PK  CR-0201 OVERDRAFT LIMITS.                       *
      * 1996-04-15 PK  CR-0233 TRANSFERS, POSTED IN LEGS OVER THREE    *
      *                RUNS. AUDIT AND REJECTS ARE APPENDED TO.        *
      * 1999-01-11 SL  Y2K: 8-DIGIT DATES IN THE AUDIT TRAIL.          *
      * 2003-05-19 MV  CR-0342 CARD AND ATM TRANSACTIONS, AUTHORIZED   *
      *                ONLINE, POST WHATEVER THE BALANCE.              *
      * 2003-05-26 MV  CR-0352 FEES POST EVEN PAST THE OVERDRAFT       *
      *                LIMIT.                                          *
      * 2001-09-03 TL  CR-0298 MONTH-END INTEREST AND FEES.            *
      * 2011-08-15 MV  CR-0471 RECONCILE THE NEW MASTER BEFORE         *
      *                ENDING THE RUN.                                 *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TXPOST.
       AUTHOR. J. ARKWRIGHT, BATCH SYSTEMS.
       INSTALLATION. FIRST BANK OF PANGAEA, DATA CENTER.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 1987-04-02.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CONTROL-FILE ASSIGN TO BANKCTL
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CONTROL-STATUS.
           SELECT ACCT-IN      ASSIGN TO ACCTIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ACCT-IN-STATUS.
           SELECT TRAN-IN      ASSIGN TO TRANIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-TRAN-IN-STATUS.
           SELECT ACCT-OUT     ASSIGN TO ACCTOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-ACCT-OUT-STATUS.
           SELECT OPTIONAL AUDIT-OUT ASSIGN TO AUDIT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-AUDIT-STATUS.
           SELECT OPTIONAL REJECT-OUT ASSIGN TO REJECTS
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-REJECT-STATUS.
           SELECT LEGS-OUT     ASSIGN TO LEGS
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-LEGS-STATUS.
           SELECT REPORT-OUT   ASSIGN TO POSTRPT
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-REPORT-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CONTROL-FILE.
           COPY BANKCTL.
       FD  ACCT-IN.
           COPY ACCTMAST.
       FD  TRAN-IN.
           COPY TRANREC.
       FD  ACCT-OUT.
       01  ACCT-OUT-RECORD             PIC X(100).
       FD  AUDIT-OUT.
       01  AUDIT-OUT-RECORD            PIC X(100).
       FD  REJECT-OUT.
       01  REJECT-OUT-RECORD           PIC X(100).
       FD  LEGS-OUT.
       01  LEGS-OUT-RECORD             PIC X(80).
       FD  REPORT-OUT.
       01  REPORT-LINE                 PIC X(80).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FILE-STATUSES.
           05  WS-CONTROL-STATUS       PIC XX.
           05  WS-ACCT-IN-STATUS       PIC XX.
           05  WS-TRAN-IN-STATUS       PIC XX.
           05  WS-ACCT-OUT-STATUS      PIC XX.
           05  WS-AUDIT-STATUS         PIC XX.
               88  AUDIT-OPENED        VALUE '00' '05'.
           05  WS-REJECT-STATUS        PIC XX.
               88  REJECTS-OPENED      VALUE '00' '05'.
           05  WS-LEGS-STATUS          PIC XX.
           05  WS-REPORT-STATUS        PIC XX.

       01  WS-BUSINESS-DATE            PIC 9(8).
       01  WS-ABORT-MESSAGE            PIC X(40).

      * MATCH KEYS: HIGH-VALUES ONCE A FILE IS AT ITS END.
       01  WS-MASTER-KEY               PIC X(10).
       01  WS-TRAN-KEY                 PIC X(10).
       01  WS-PREV-MASTER-KEY          PIC X(10)      VALUE LOW-VALUES.
       01  WS-TRAN-ORDER-KEY.
           05  WS-TOK-ACCT-NO          PIC X(10).
           05  WS-TOK-TRAN-ID          PIC X(10).
       01  WS-PREV-TRAN-ORDER-KEY      PIC X(20)      VALUE LOW-VALUES.

       01  WS-POSTING.
           05  WS-BALANCE-BEFORE       PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  WS-NEW-BALANCE          PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  WS-BALANCE-FLOOR        PIC S9(11)V99.
           05  WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT        PIC S9(9)V99.

      * A LEG IS WRITTEN FROM THE TRANSACTION RECORD ITSELF, TURNED
      * AROUND; THE TRANSACTION IS SAVED HERE AND PUT BACK AFTER.
       01  WS-SAVED-TRAN               PIC X(80).
       01  WS-LEG-ACCT-NO              PIC 9(10).

       01  WS-TOTALS.
           05  WS-MASTERS-READ         PIC 9(8)       VALUE 0.
           05  WS-MASTERS-WRITTEN      PIC 9(8)       VALUE 0.
           05  WS-POSTED-COUNT         PIC 9(8)       VALUE 0.
           05  WS-REJECT-COUNT         PIC 9(8)       VALUE 0.
           05  WS-LEG-COUNT            PIC 9(8)       VALUE 0.
           05  WS-OPENING-TOTAL        PIC S9(13)V99  VALUE 0.
           05  WS-CREDIT-TOTAL         PIC 9(13)V99   VALUE 0.
           05  WS-DEBIT-TOTAL          PIC 9(13)V99   VALUE 0.
           05  WS-FEE-TOTAL            PIC 9(13)V99   VALUE 0.
           05  WS-CLOSING-TOTAL        PIC S9(13)V99  VALUE 0.
           05  WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL       PIC S9(13)V99  VALUE 0.

           COPY AUDITREC.

           COPY REJREC.

       01  WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE.
           05  WS-RC-LABEL             PIC X(30).
           05  WS-RC-VALUE             PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(40)      VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE.
           05  WS-RA-LABEL             PIC X(30).
           05  WS-RA-VALUE             PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.99-.
           05  FILLER                  PIC X(29)      VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      * MATCH UNTIL BOTH FILES END, THEN RECONCILE AND REPORT.
       0000-MAIN.
           PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE
           PERFORM 2000-MATCH
               UNTIL WS-MASTER-KEY = HIGH-VALUES
                 AND WS-TRAN-KEY = HIGH-VALUES
           PERFORM 5000-RECONCILE
           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-REPORT
           PERFORM 9000-CLOSE-FILES
           IF WS-REJECT-COUNT > 0
               MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
           END-IF
           STOP RUN.

      * OPEN THE FILES AND READ THE FIRST RECORD OF EACH. THE AUDIT
      * TRAIL AND THE REJECTS ARE EXTENDED, AND CREATED IF NEW.
       1000-INITIALIZE.
           OPEN INPUT  CONTROL-FILE ACCT-IN TRAN-IN
                OUTPUT ACCT-OUT LEGS-OUT REPORT-OUT
                EXTEND AUDIT-OUT REJECT-OUT
           IF WS-CONTROL-STATUS NOT = '00'
              OR WS-ACCT-IN-STATUS NOT = '00'
              OR WS-TRAN-IN-STATUS NOT = '00'
              OR WS-ACCT-OUT-STATUS NOT = '00'
              OR NOT AUDIT-OPENED
              OR NOT REJECTS-OPENED
              OR WS-LEGS-STATUS NOT = '00'
              OR WS-REPORT-STATUS NOT = '00'
               DISPLAY 'TXPOST: CANNOT OPEN FILES ' WS-FILE-STATUSES
               MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
               STOP RUN
           END-IF
           READ CONTROL-FILE
               AT END
                   MOVE 'NO BANK CONTROL RECORD' TO WS-ABORT-MESSAGE
                   PERFORM 9900-ABORT
           END-READ
           MOVE BC-BUSINESS-DATE TO WS-BUSINESS-DATE
           MOVE SPACES TO AUDIT-RECORD REJECT-RECORD
           PERFORM 1200-READ-MASTER
           PERFORM 1300-READ-TRAN.

      * READ THE NEXT OLD MASTER RECORD, CHECKING ACCOUNT ORDER.
       1200-READ-MASTER.
           READ ACCT-IN
               AT END
                   MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO WS-MASTER-KEY
               NOT AT END
                   MOVE AM-ACCT-NO TO WS-MASTER-KEY
                   IF WS-MASTER-KEY NOT > WS-PREV-MASTER-KEY
                       MOVE 'MASTER NOT IN ACCOUNT ORDER'
                           TO WS-ABORT-MESSAGE
                       PERFORM 9900-ABORT
                   END-IF
                   MOVE WS-MASTER-KEY TO WS-PREV-MASTER-KEY
                   ADD 1 TO WS-MASTERS-READ
                   ADD AM-BALANCE TO WS-OPENING-TOTAL
           END-READ.

      * READ THE NEXT TRANSACTION, CHECKING ITS ORDER.
       1300-READ-TRAN.
           READ TRAN-IN
               AT END
                   MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO WS-TRAN-KEY
               NOT AT END
                   MOVE TD-ACCT-NO TO WS-TRAN-KEY WS-TOK-ACCT-NO
                   MOVE TD-TRAN-ID TO WS-TOK-TRAN-ID
                   IF WS-TRAN-ORDER-KEY NOT > WS-PREV-TRAN-ORDER-KEY
                       MOVE 'TRANSACTIONS NOT IN ACCOUNT ORDER'
                           TO WS-ABORT-MESSAGE
                       PERFORM 9900-ABORT
                   END-IF
                   MOVE WS-TRAN-ORDER-KEY TO WS-PREV-TRAN-ORDER-KEY
           END-READ.

      * ONE STEP OF THE MATCH, BY WHICHEVER KEY IS LOWER: REJECT A
      * TRANSACTION FOR A MISSING ACCOUNT, APPLY ONE TO ITS ACCOUNT, OR
      * WRITE A FINISHED ACCOUNT.
       2000-MATCH.
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN WS-TRAN-KEY < WS-MASTER-KEY
                   SET RJ-NO-ACCOUNT TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 3900-REJECT-TRAN
                   PERFORM 1300-READ-TRAN
               WHEN WS-TRAN-KEY = WS-MASTER-KEY
                   PERFORM 3000-APPLY-TRAN
                   PERFORM 1300-READ-TRAN
               WHEN OTHER
                   PERFORM 4000-WRITE-MASTER
                   PERFORM 1200-READ-MASTER
           END-EVALUATE.

      * APPLY ONE TRANSACTION TO ITS ACCOUNT BY THE POSTING RULES.
       3000-APPLY-TRAN.
           MOVE AM-BALANCE TO WS-BALANCE-BEFORE
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN AM-CLOSED
                   SET RJ-CLOSED TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 3900-REJECT-TRAN
               WHEN TD-DEPOSIT
                 OR TD-TRANSFER-CREDIT
                 OR TD-TRANSFER-RETURN
                 OR TD-INTEREST
                   PERFORM 3100-POST-CREDIT
               WHEN TD-FEE
                 OR TD-OVERDRAFT-INTEREST
                 OR TD-MAINTENANCE-FEE
                 OR TD-ATM-FEE
                   PERFORM 3300-POST-FEE
               WHEN TD-CARD-PURCHASE
                 OR TD-ATM-WITHDRAWAL
                   PERFORM 3400-POST-AUTHORIZED
               WHEN AM-FROZEN
                   SET RJ-FROZEN TO TRUE
                   PERFORM 3900-REJECT-TRAN
               WHEN TD-WITHDRAWAL
                 OR TD-TRANSFER
                   PERFORM 3200-POST-DEBIT
           END-EVALUATE.

      * CREDIT A DEPOSIT, A TRANSFER CREDIT, A RETURNED TRANSFER OR
      * INTEREST.
       3100-POST-CREDIT.
           ADD TD-AMOUNT TO AM-BALANCE
           ADD TD-AMOUNT TO WS-CREDIT-TOTAL
           MOVE TD-AMOUNT TO WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 3800-WRITE-AUDIT.

      * DEBIT A WITHDRAWAL OR TRANSFER IF IT STAYS WITHIN THE
      * OVERDRAFT LIMIT. A POSTED TRANSFER SENDS ITS CREDIT ON.
       3200-POST-DEBIT.
           COMPUTE WS-NEW-BALANCE = AM-BALANCE - TD-AMOUNT
           COMPUTE WS-BALANCE-FLOOR = 0 - AM-OVERDRAFT-LIMIT
           IF WS-NEW-BALANCE < WS-BALANCE-FLOOR
               SET RJ-NO-FUNDS TO TRUE
               PERFORM 3900-REJECT-TRAN
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-NEW-BALANCE TO AM-BALANCE
               ADD TD-AMOUNT TO WS-DEBIT-TOTAL
               COMPUTE WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT = 0 - TD-AMOUNT
               PERFORM 3800-WRITE-AUDIT
               IF TD-TRANSFER
                   PERFORM 3500-WRITE-LEG
               END-IF
           END-IF.

      * DEBIT A FEE, OVERDRAFT INTEREST, A MAINTENANCE FEE OR AN ATM
      * FEE, WHATEVER THE BALANCE.
       3300-POST-FEE.
           SUBTRACT TD-AMOUNT FROM AM-BALANCE
           ADD TD-AMOUNT TO WS-FEE-TOTAL
           COMPUTE WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT = 0 - TD-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 3800-WRITE-AUDIT.

      * DEBIT A CARD PURCHASE OR ATM WITHDRAWAL AUTHORIZED ONLINE,
      * WHATEVER THE BALANCE.
       3400-POST-AUTHORIZED.
           SUBTRACT TD-AMOUNT FROM AM-BALANCE
           ADD TD-AMOUNT TO WS-DEBIT-TOTAL
           COMPUTE WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT = 0 - TD-AMOUNT
           PERFORM 3800-WRITE-AUDIT.

      * WRITE THE NEXT LEG OF A TRANSFER FOR THE COUNTER ACCOUNT: A
      * TRANSFER CREDIT AFTER A TRANSFER, A RETURN AFTER A CREDIT
      * THAT COULD NOT POST.
       3500-WRITE-LEG.
           MOVE TRAN-RECORD TO WS-SAVED-TRAN
           IF TD-TRANSFER
               SET TD-TRANSFER-CREDIT TO TRUE
           ELSE
               SET TD-TRANSFER-RETURN TO TRUE
           END-IF
           MOVE TD-ACCT-NO TO WS-LEG-ACCT-NO
           MOVE TD-COUNTER-ACCT-NO TO TD-ACCT-NO
           MOVE WS-LEG-ACCT-NO TO TD-COUNTER-ACCT-NO
           WRITE LEGS-OUT-RECORD FROM TRAN-RECORD
           ADD 1 TO WS-LEG-COUNT
           MOVE WS-SAVED-TRAN TO TRAN-RECORD.

      * RECORD A POSTING IN THE AUDIT TRAIL.
       3800-WRITE-AUDIT.
           MOVE WS-BUSINESS-DATE  TO AU-BUSINESS-DATE
                                     AM-LAST-ACTIVITY-DATE
           MOVE TD-TRAN-ID        TO AU-TRAN-ID
           MOVE TD-ACCT-NO        TO AU-ACCT-NO
           MOVE TD-TRAN-CODE      TO AU-TRAN-CODE
           MOVE WS-SIGNED-AMOUNT  TO AU-AMOUNT
           MOVE WS-BALANCE-BEFORE TO AU-BALANCE-BEFORE
           MOVE AM-BALANCE        TO AU-BALANCE-AFTER
           WRITE AUDIT-OUT-RECORD FROM AUDIT-RECORD
           ADD 1 TO WS-POSTED-COUNT.

      * WRITE THE TRANSACTION TO THE REJECTS WITH ITS REASON. A
      * TRANSFER CREDIT THAT CANNOT POST GOES BACK TO ITS SENDER.
       3900-REJECT-TRAN.
           MOVE 'TXPOST' TO RJ-PROGRAM
           MOVE TRAN-RECORD TO RJ-TRAN
           WRITE REJECT-OUT-RECORD FROM REJECT-RECORD
           ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-COUNT
           IF TD-TRANSFER-CREDIT
               PERFORM 3500-WRITE-LEG
           END-IF.

      * WRITE AN ACCOUNT, ITS TRANSACTIONS APPLIED, TO THE NEW MASTER.
       4000-WRITE-MASTER.
           WRITE ACCT-OUT-RECORD FROM ACCT-MASTER-RECORD
           ADD 1 TO WS-MASTERS-WRITTEN
           ADD AM-BALANCE TO WS-CLOSING-TOTAL.

      * THE NEW MASTER MUST HOLD THE OLD BALANCES PLUS WHAT WAS POSTED.
       5000-RECONCILE.
           MOVE WS-OPENING-TOTAL TO WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL
           ADD WS-CREDIT-TOTAL TO WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL
           SUBTRACT WS-DEBIT-TOTAL FROM WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL
           SUBTRACT WS-FEE-TOTAL FROM WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL
           IF WS-EXPECTED-TOTAL NOT = WS-CLOSING-TOTAL
              OR WS-MASTERS-WRITTEN NOT = WS-MASTERS-READ
               MOVE 'NEW MASTER OUT OF BALANCE' TO WS-ABORT-MESSAGE
               PERFORM 9900-ABORT
           END-IF.

      * WRITE THE POSTING REPORT.
       8000-WRITE-REPORT.
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-LINE
           STRING 'TXPOST   TRANSACTION POSTING     BUSINESS DATE '
                  WS-BUSINESS-DATE
               DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO REPORT-LINE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-LINE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE
           MOVE 'ACCOUNTS READ' TO WS-RC-LABEL
           MOVE WS-MASTERS-READ TO WS-RC-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'ACCOUNTS WRITTEN' TO WS-RC-LABEL
           MOVE WS-MASTERS-WRITTEN TO WS-RC-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'TRANSACTIONS POSTED' TO WS-RC-LABEL
           MOVE WS-POSTED-COUNT TO WS-RC-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'TRANSACTIONS REJECTED' TO WS-RC-LABEL
           MOVE WS-REJECT-COUNT TO WS-RC-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'TRANSFER LEGS WRITTEN' TO WS-RC-LABEL
           MOVE WS-LEG-COUNT TO WS-RC-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-COUNT-LINE
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-LINE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE
           MOVE 'OPENING BALANCES' TO WS-RA-LABEL
           MOVE WS-OPENING-TOTAL TO WS-RA-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'CREDITS' TO WS-RA-LABEL
           MOVE WS-CREDIT-TOTAL TO WS-RA-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'DEBITS' TO WS-RA-LABEL
           MOVE WS-DEBIT-TOTAL TO WS-RA-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'FEES' TO WS-RA-LABEL
           MOVE WS-FEE-TOTAL TO WS-RA-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE
           MOVE 'CLOSING BALANCES' TO WS-RA-LABEL
           MOVE WS-CLOSING-TOTAL TO WS-RA-VALUE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM WS-REPORT-AMOUNT-LINE
           MOVE SPACES TO REPORT-LINE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE
           MOVE 'NEW MASTER IN BALANCE' TO REPORT-LINE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE.

      * CLOSE ALL FILES.
       9000-CLOSE-FILES.
           CLOSE CONTROL-FILE ACCT-IN TRAN-IN ACCT-OUT
                 AUDIT-OUT REJECT-OUT LEGS-OUT REPORT-OUT.

      * STOP THE RUN WITH RETURN CODE 16, SAYING WHY.
       9900-ABORT.
           DISPLAY 'TXPOST: ' WS-ABORT-MESSAGE
           PERFORM 9000-CLOSE-FILES
           MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
